# ex48 — zero subject fixture (mirrors demos/9-nihongo/48-zero-subject.bqn)
# world rows ⟨"tree",0‿0⟩ ⟨"rock",5‿1⟩ ⟨"tree",2‿7⟩ as columns; the cursor raycast point 3‿4 is the registered spawn default for x and y.
n 3
col type sym tree rock tree
col wheat bool 0 0 0
col x num 0 5 2
col y num 0 1 7
default x 3
default y 4
alias cursor 1 0 0
